    "text": "package Expr_Func is\n\n   type State is (Off, On, Waiting, Invalid);\n\n   function Toggled (S : State) return State is\n     (case S is\n       when Off    => On,\n       when On     => Off,\n       when others => S);\n\nend Expr_Func;\n",
